---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout lang="en" title="Privacy Policy | BrewMind" description="BrewMind's privacy policy is currently available in German only.">
  <Header />
  <main class="pt-28 pb-20 px-6">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

      <p>
        The privacy policy for BrewMind is currently available in German only. The German
        version is the binding one and describes the app as it is today, including the account
        and shared households.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="/datenschutz/">Datenschutzerklärung (German)</a>
      </p>
      <p>
        How to delete your account and data is explained, also in German, on the page
        <a href="/loeschen/">Konto und Daten löschen</a>. If you have a question, write to
        <a href="mailto:hello@brewmind.app">hello@brewmind.app</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="stand">Last updated: November 25, 2026</p>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
